<h1>TUI controls</h1>
<p>Run <code>wifimap</code> for the live survey dashboard or <code>wifimap eval</code> for saved readings. Add <code>--demo</code> to explore either view with isolated simulated data. Press <kbd>?</kbd> to open help; <kbd>?</kbd> or <kbd>Escape</kbd> closes it.</p>

<h2>Survey dashboard</h2>
<p>These primary shortcuts come from the application's <code>capabilities</code> output. See <a href="/walk-tui/">Walk TUI</a> for capture behavior and measurement limits.</p>
