<h2>Connection diagnostics</h2>
<p>Press <kbd>d</kbd> in the survey dashboard. <kbd>Tab</kbd> or <kbd>Shift-Tab</kbd> switches between events and samples. Use <kbd>↑</kbd> / <kbd>↓</kbd>, <kbd>j</kbd> / <kbd>k</kbd>, or <kbd>Home</kbd> / <kbd>End</kbd> to scroll. <kbd>t</kbd> starts an unsaved speed probe; <kbd>d</kbd> or <kbd>Escape</kbd> returns to the dashboard.</p>

